1
00:01:35,830 --> 00:01:39,900
[Abyss]

2
00:01:46,509 --> 00:01:47,710
Who let you in?

3
00:01:49,100 --> 00:01:49,740
Fan Jie.

4
00:01:58,160 --> 00:01:59,500
I know why you're here.

5
00:02:01,410 --> 00:02:02,810
But I'm a police officer.

6
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,900
We need evidence to handle a case.

7
00:02:04,900 --> 00:02:06,530
Right now, all evidence points to

8
00:02:06,530 --> 00:02:08,280
your mom dying in a traffic accident.

9
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,090
Impossible.

10
00:02:09,780 --> 00:02:10,970
How could it be such a coincidence?

11
00:02:10,970 --> 00:02:11,710
The one who ran over my mom

12
00:02:11,710 --> 00:02:13,020
happens to be that bitch's colleague.

13
00:02:13,020 --> 00:02:13,780
How is that possible?

14
00:02:13,780 --> 00:02:15,240
I understand how you feel.

15
00:02:15,460 --> 00:02:17,930
But just because the driver knows Du Juan

16
00:02:18,150 --> 00:02:19,750
doesn't mean she ordered it.

17
00:02:20,340 --> 00:02:21,690
We can't solve cases on speculation alone.

18
00:02:21,690 --> 00:02:23,020
If your investigation was solid enough,

19
00:02:23,020 --> 00:02:24,210
would I need to speculate? Would I?

20
00:02:24,210 --> 00:02:26,670
We're not just investigating
for you alone!

21
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:36,760
I've told you already.

22
00:02:37,460 --> 00:02:38,710
The driver was drunk.

23
00:02:39,620 --> 00:02:42,079
The speed, route, and angle of impact

24
00:02:42,079 --> 00:02:43,579
all match an accident.

25
00:02:43,690 --> 00:02:45,710
He has also pleaded guilty
and accepted the punishment.

26
00:02:45,710 --> 00:02:47,240
The case is legally closed.

27
00:02:57,510 --> 00:02:59,060
Officer Xin, I'm begging you.

28
00:02:59,060 --> 00:03:00,730
Please investigate it again.

29
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,210
Please.

30
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,660
She's my mom.

31
00:03:03,870 --> 00:03:04,970
She was holding

32
00:03:04,970 --> 00:03:06,680
the scrambled eggs she made for me.

33
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,870
People saw it.

34
00:03:07,870 --> 00:03:09,470
They said when she was hit,

35
00:03:09,470 --> 00:03:11,180
the box was crushed.

36
00:03:11,180 --> 00:03:12,690
Her brains, her blood, and the eggs

37
00:03:12,690 --> 00:03:13,870
were all mixed together.

38
00:03:13,870 --> 00:03:15,520
You couldn't even tell them apart.

39
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:17,570
I beg you to look into it again.

40
00:03:17,590 --> 00:03:19,820
What did my mom do wrong?

41
00:03:19,930 --> 00:03:20,780
Did she deserve to be run over

42
00:03:20,780 --> 00:03:22,530
because she didn't make way

43
00:03:22,530 --> 00:03:24,640
for that bitch sooner?

44
00:03:24,740 --> 00:03:25,500
I'm begging you.

45
00:03:25,500 --> 00:03:26,810
Officer Xin, please investigate it again.

46
00:03:26,810 --> 00:03:28,870
-Please investigate it again.
-Kid.

47
00:03:29,530 --> 00:03:31,570
Kneeling only gets you sympathy,

48
00:03:31,790 --> 00:03:33,079
not the truth.

49
00:03:39,050 --> 00:03:40,320
I'm a police officer.

50
00:03:41,579 --> 00:03:43,440
I only care about right and wrong,

51
00:03:44,190 --> 00:03:45,520
not personal feelings.

52
00:03:48,900 --> 00:03:50,500
Captain Xin, we got news.

53
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:51,900
The target has appeared.

54
00:03:55,020 --> 00:03:55,710
Let's go.

55
00:04:00,630 --> 00:04:01,750
Come on, get up, get up.

56
00:04:01,750 --> 00:04:03,250
You can't just walk in here.

57
00:04:03,250 --> 00:04:04,240
This is an office.

58
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,020
It holds classified information.

59
00:04:05,020 --> 00:04:06,180
Come on.

60
00:04:20,649 --> 00:04:21,380
Mom.

61
00:04:22,890 --> 00:04:25,020
Today is the 49th day since you passed.

62
00:04:25,450 --> 00:04:26,780
I'm here to see you.

63
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,660
I found a job.

64
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:34,230
Working at the internet cafe
near our home.

65
00:04:35,650 --> 00:04:37,350
The boss is pretty nice,

66
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,860
and the work isn't tiring.

67
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,740
I can

68
00:04:43,570 --> 00:04:45,420
support myself now.

69
00:04:56,740 --> 00:04:58,800
The police have their rules,

70
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:02,300
and a son has his duty.

71
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:06,400
I will settle the score
with those who hurt you,

72
00:05:06,430 --> 00:05:10,120
one by one.

73
00:05:12,170 --> 00:05:13,440
Take care

74
00:05:14,100 --> 00:05:16,910
♪ I once fell into a dream ♪

75
00:05:14,220 --> 00:05:15,390
on your way.

76
00:05:16,630 --> 00:05:17,620
Just wait and see.

77
00:05:17,620 --> 00:05:19,510
No!

78
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:22,680
♪ Inside I lost my name ♪

79
00:05:23,510 --> 00:05:27,200
♪ The sun hit my face straight ♪

80
00:05:27,910 --> 00:05:34,030
♪ And left me ashamed. Who is who? ♪

81
00:05:28,540 --> 00:05:29,250
Dad.

82
00:05:29,750 --> 00:05:31,060
The doctor said

83
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:34,710
the tumor on your liver
is bigger than a fist.

84
00:05:35,420 --> 00:05:37,020
There's nothing they can do.

85
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:45,770
♪ Who is who? ♪

86
00:05:46,540 --> 00:05:48,840
♪ Who bears deep sin still praying? ♪

87
00:05:49,510 --> 00:05:51,320
Mom is over there

88
00:05:49,710 --> 00:05:50,930
♪ Who is who? ♪

89
00:05:51,659 --> 00:05:54,100
♪ Who shuts their eyes
and begs for rights? ♪

90
00:05:52,290 --> 00:05:53,750
waiting for you so long.

91
00:05:54,950 --> 00:05:57,159
♪ Why is the blade red with the blood? ♪

92
00:05:56,150 --> 00:05:58,080
You've lived on borrowed time for years.

93
00:05:57,650 --> 00:05:59,250
♪ They call it just and true ♪

94
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:02,100
♪ Why is the slaughter made so cold? ♪

95
00:05:59,730 --> 00:06:02,650
It's time to go to the underworld
and make amends to her.

96
00:06:02,650 --> 00:06:04,170
♪ They say it was meant to ♪

97
00:06:04,870 --> 00:06:06,990
♪ Why can the one who saves not save? ♪

98
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:09,680
♪ Why does the one
who fights to guard me? ♪

99
00:06:10,150 --> 00:06:11,730
♪ Why did they chain your two hands? ♪

100
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:16,480
♪ Then judge what they believe? ♪

101
00:06:28,050 --> 00:06:29,970
♪ All things will fade into night ♪

102
00:06:30,460 --> 00:06:35,520
♪ Your mind will break, then take flight ♪

103
00:06:36,630 --> 00:06:41,380
[Episode 14]

104
00:06:49,180 --> 00:06:50,250
Bro.

105
00:06:49,260 --> 00:06:51,450
[Ping'an Urban District]

106
00:06:50,900 --> 00:06:51,540
Bro.

107
00:06:52,250 --> 00:06:53,159
Wake up, bro.

108
00:06:53,590 --> 00:06:55,600
I'm turning right at the intersection
ahead to deliver goods.

109
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:57,370
After unloading, I'll get on the highway.

110
00:06:57,370 --> 00:06:58,390
I'm not going into the city.

111
00:06:58,390 --> 00:06:59,520
You can get off here.

112
00:07:09,180 --> 00:07:09,920
Thanks.

113
00:07:12,900 --> 00:07:13,640
See you.

114
00:07:24,900 --> 00:07:29,220
[Ping'an Urban District]

115
00:07:43,860 --> 00:07:45,330
One, come on, go.

116
00:08:32,470 --> 00:08:33,270
Mr. Li!

117
00:08:33,549 --> 00:08:34,320
Mr. Li!

118
00:08:35,740 --> 00:08:36,880
Come down for a sec.

119
00:08:38,740 --> 00:08:39,429
What's wrong?

120
00:08:39,429 --> 00:08:40,460
Mr. Li, look.

121
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,120
These marks

122
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,600
look like an impact crater

123
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,620
formed by someone
jumping from a high place

124
00:08:53,620 --> 00:08:54,960
and landing on their forefeet.

125
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:55,680
Right.

126
00:08:55,860 --> 00:08:56,960
They even tried to fill it with dirt

127
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:57,870
to cover their tracks.

128
00:08:57,870 --> 00:08:58,790
But they left in a hurry

129
00:08:58,790 --> 00:08:59,740
and didn't clean it up properly.

130
00:08:59,740 --> 00:09:01,050
I'll contact the forensics team right away

131
00:09:01,050 --> 00:09:03,010
to see if they can extract
the footprints and fingerprints.

132
00:09:03,010 --> 00:09:03,650
Okay.

133
00:09:09,880 --> 00:09:11,070
Zhang Alin.

134
00:09:12,050 --> 00:09:13,360
From 2002 to 2006,

135
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:15,870
did you work
at Zhang Quan's construction site

136
00:09:15,870 --> 00:09:17,750
and share a dorm with Song Laifu?

137
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,890
Yes, Officer.

138
00:09:19,910 --> 00:09:21,440
How was your relationship?

139
00:09:21,510 --> 00:09:23,750
Reporting. It was okay.

140
00:09:27,620 --> 00:09:29,740
Take a close look at this person.

141
00:09:29,740 --> 00:09:31,500
You don't have to answer me right away.

142
00:09:31,500 --> 00:09:32,690
Think carefully.

143
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:35,250
He looks a bit like Song Laifu,

144
00:09:35,500 --> 00:09:36,600
quite tall.

145
00:09:36,820 --> 00:09:38,950
He wasn't at the site for long

146
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:42,060
and disappeared
around the same time as Song Laifu.

147
00:09:43,180 --> 00:09:44,350
Reporting.

148
00:09:44,730 --> 00:09:46,070
I-I have some impression of him.

149
00:09:46,070 --> 00:09:47,390
Tell me about it.

150
00:09:48,460 --> 00:09:50,320
He was only there for a few months.

151
00:09:50,370 --> 00:09:52,270
This guy didn't talk much

152
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:53,870
and didn't like interacting with people.

153
00:09:53,870 --> 00:09:55,710
But he was pretty ruthless.

154
00:09:55,730 --> 00:09:56,360
With one swing of a hammer,

155
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,690
he nailed someone's hand to the bed board.

156
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:16,790
Newbie?

157
00:10:19,780 --> 00:10:20,800
Got any smokes?

158
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,270
Got any smokes?

159
00:10:27,850 --> 00:10:28,490
Yeah,

160
00:10:29,140 --> 00:10:31,340
under the mattress. Get them yourself.

161
00:10:33,150 --> 00:10:34,300
Where?

162
00:10:39,250 --> 00:10:41,580
Next time you do this,
I'll nail your neck.

163
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:47,410
Well, we didn't live together.

164
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,150
I didn't dare to tell

165
00:10:48,150 --> 00:10:49,670
anyone about this.

166
00:10:49,870 --> 00:10:51,750
I was afraid he'd get back at me.

167
00:10:51,750 --> 00:10:53,500
Do you know his name?

168
00:10:54,010 --> 00:10:55,600
Back then, Song Laifu and I

169
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:57,050
both called him San.

170
00:10:57,260 --> 00:10:59,720
Because he was the third child
in his family.

171
00:10:59,890 --> 00:11:01,490
His surname seemed to be Guo.

172
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,290
Guo San...

173
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:05,410
Guo San something...

174
00:11:06,470 --> 00:11:08,880
Reporting. I can't remember.

175
00:11:09,820 --> 00:11:11,290
Do you know anything else?

176
00:11:13,040 --> 00:11:13,660
Right.

177
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:15,560
Song Laifu

178
00:11:15,590 --> 00:11:17,740
seemed to have asked him
where he was from.

179
00:11:17,740 --> 00:11:20,650
He said his hometown was Quanlin County.

180
00:11:20,820 --> 00:11:27,370
[Dedicated to Duty,
Build a Harmonious Prison Compound]

181
00:11:22,790 --> 00:11:24,470
Hurry up and go to Quanlin County.

182
00:11:24,470 --> 00:11:25,980
Call Xu Ling and ask her to issue

183
00:11:25,980 --> 00:11:27,810
another investigation notice for us.

184
00:11:27,810 --> 00:11:28,520
Okay.

185
00:11:28,700 --> 00:11:29,630
Let's go.

186
00:11:30,660 --> 00:11:31,700
[Dedicated to Duty,
Build a Harmonious Prison Compound]

187
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:43,530
Captain Fan.

188
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:44,650
How is it?

189
00:11:45,780 --> 00:11:46,870
The murder weapon is confirmed.

190
00:11:46,870 --> 00:11:47,960
It's the bronze antelope ornament

191
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,480
from Han Pinmu's home.

192
00:11:49,630 --> 00:11:50,890
Although it was wiped,

193
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:52,530
a trace amount of blood
was still extracted

194
00:11:52,530 --> 00:11:54,050
from the gap at the bottom.

195
00:11:54,370 --> 00:11:55,370
DNA matching

196
00:11:55,370 --> 00:11:57,500
has confirmed it belongs to Han Pinmu.

197
00:11:57,870 --> 00:11:58,670
What about the fingerprints?

198
00:11:58,670 --> 00:12:00,890
The fingerprints on the outer edge
of the window matched

199
00:12:00,890 --> 00:12:01,980
Chen Chunli's.

200
00:12:04,150 --> 00:12:05,510
So suspicion against Xin

201
00:12:05,510 --> 00:12:06,720
should be lessened.

202
00:12:06,740 --> 00:12:09,960
Why would Chen Chunli
go to Han Pinmu's home?

203
00:12:10,820 --> 00:12:12,050
Although a complete shoe print
couldn't be extracted

204
00:12:12,050 --> 00:12:14,010
from the impact crater outside the window,

205
00:12:14,010 --> 00:12:15,910
judging by the size and depth,

206
00:12:15,940 --> 00:12:18,260
it was a female
weighing about 50 kilograms.

207
00:12:18,260 --> 00:12:19,790
Combined with Chen Chunli's fingerprints

208
00:12:19,790 --> 00:12:21,670
we extracted from the outer edge
of the window,

209
00:12:20,600 --> 00:12:21,870
[Huangshui Public Security Bureau]
[Fingerprint Identification Report]

210
00:12:21,670 --> 00:12:22,840
we can almost determine that

211
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:23,910
on the night of the incident,

212
00:12:23,910 --> 00:12:25,870
besides Xin Jiran and Han Pinmu,

213
00:12:25,870 --> 00:12:28,240
Chen Chunli also accessed the crime scene.

214
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,110
Li Cheng,

215
00:12:29,290 --> 00:12:32,030
you just said the murder weapon was wiped.

216
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:33,270
Yes.

217
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:35,050
Not only was the murder weapon wiped,

218
00:12:35,050 --> 00:12:37,510
but also the floor
and the inside of the window.

219
00:12:37,510 --> 00:12:38,840
If Chen Chunli had been in such a hurry

220
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,630
that she had to jump out of
the second-floor window to escape,

221
00:12:40,630 --> 00:12:42,950
she wouldn't have had time
to clean up the scene.

222
00:12:42,950 --> 00:12:43,940
Could it be that

223
00:12:44,170 --> 00:12:45,690
someone was cleaning up after her?

224
00:12:45,690 --> 00:12:46,860
Very likely.

225
00:12:46,910 --> 00:12:48,790
Chen Chunli entered Han Pinmu's home

226
00:12:48,790 --> 00:12:50,390
before Xin Jiran went there.

227
00:12:51,410 --> 00:12:53,260
This is really strange.

228
00:12:53,410 --> 00:12:55,050
Han Pinmu is a family member
of the victim

229
00:12:55,050 --> 00:12:56,850
in the 4th case of the 3/12 Case.

230
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:57,740
Chen Chunli

231
00:12:57,740 --> 00:12:59,650
is the direct victim of the 5th case.

232
00:12:59,650 --> 00:13:00,630
Why would they meet

233
00:13:00,630 --> 00:13:01,960
at Han Pinmu's home?

234
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:03,080
Stop guessing.

235
00:13:03,460 --> 00:13:05,320
Summon Chen Chunli immediately.

236
00:13:13,030 --> 00:13:14,120
Chunli, you're here.

237
00:13:14,120 --> 00:13:15,580
What are you buying today?

238
00:13:16,030 --> 00:13:17,440
I sprained my ankle while working.

239
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:18,950
I'm here to buy some medicine.

240
00:13:18,950 --> 00:13:20,770
Why are you always so careless?

241
00:13:21,130 --> 00:13:22,640
Alright, use this then.

242
00:13:25,100 --> 00:13:25,960
Take this one.

243
00:13:25,980 --> 00:13:27,480
It's a big brand,

244
00:13:27,530 --> 00:13:29,730
and most importantly, it's very cheap.

245
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:31,740
Just rub some on when you get home,

246
00:13:31,740 --> 00:13:32,670
and you'll be fine.

247
00:13:32,670 --> 00:13:33,440
It works wonders.

248
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,670
Here, take a bag.

249
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,100
No need.

250
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:39,720
Look at you,

251
00:13:39,740 --> 00:13:40,710
working so hard

252
00:13:40,740 --> 00:13:41,890
at your age.

253
00:13:41,890 --> 00:13:44,300
-In my opinion—
-How much is it?

254
00:13:44,340 --> 00:13:45,290
I'll give you a discount.

255
00:13:45,290 --> 00:13:46,320
Just 15.

256
00:13:46,790 --> 00:13:48,120
Like I was saying,

257
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:50,370
you need someone who cares for you, right?

258
00:13:50,370 --> 00:13:51,670
As the old saying goes,

259
00:13:51,670 --> 00:13:53,370
everyone needs a companion in old age.

260
00:13:53,370 --> 00:13:54,390
It's just about having someone

261
00:13:54,390 --> 00:13:55,670
to pour water

262
00:13:55,670 --> 00:13:56,790
or buy medicine

263
00:13:56,790 --> 00:13:58,600
when you're sick, right?

264
00:13:58,620 --> 00:13:59,960
I'm used to living alone.

265
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:00,700
Thank you.

266
00:14:02,390 --> 00:14:03,530
Take care then.

267
00:14:33,660 --> 00:14:34,540
Chen Chunli.

268
00:14:36,060 --> 00:14:37,530
We're from the county police.

269
00:14:36,750 --> 00:14:37,610
[Police] [Xiao Jie]

270
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:38,690
Come with us.

271
00:14:41,510 --> 00:14:43,100
Is there a problem?

272
00:14:43,600 --> 00:14:45,260
You'll know when we get there.

273
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,900
[Police] [Li Cheng]

274
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:58,440
Name.

275
00:15:03,630 --> 00:15:04,600
Name.

276
00:15:13,550 --> 00:15:20,480
[Ping'an City Cultural Activity Center,
Ping'an Province]

277
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:26,540
[Ping'an City Cultural Activity Center,
Ping'an Province]

278
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:33,010
Then I'll schedule you

279
00:15:33,010 --> 00:15:34,460
for Friday evening from 7 to 8.

280
00:15:34,460 --> 00:15:34,890
Is that okay?

281
00:15:34,890 --> 00:15:36,460
Yes, thank you.

282
00:15:40,510 --> 00:15:41,450
Hello.

283
00:15:41,820 --> 00:15:43,360
S-Sir, hello.

284
00:15:43,390 --> 00:15:44,740
Are you inquiring about classes

285
00:15:44,740 --> 00:15:45,790
or signing up for a membership?

286
00:15:45,790 --> 00:15:46,990
Looking for someone.

287
00:15:47,130 --> 00:15:48,290
Looking for someone?

288
00:15:48,290 --> 00:15:49,740
I'm really sorry, Sir.

289
00:15:49,740 --> 00:15:51,530
We're already closed for the day.

290
00:15:51,530 --> 00:15:53,280
And the staff have all left.

291
00:15:53,310 --> 00:15:55,470
How about you come back tomorrow?

292
00:16:05,170 --> 00:16:06,050
Officer,

293
00:16:06,050 --> 00:16:07,240
the patient is awake and wants to see you.

294
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:09,040
The doctor will be here shortly.

295
00:16:09,070 --> 00:16:09,980
Be careful.

296
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:11,100
The patient just regained consciousness

297
00:16:11,100 --> 00:16:12,630
and shouldn't be agitated.

298
00:16:25,620 --> 00:16:26,790
Why is it you?

299
00:16:27,460 --> 00:16:28,460
Where is Li Cheng?

300
00:16:28,530 --> 00:16:29,530
He's on a mission.

301
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:30,820
He's not here.

302
00:16:31,890 --> 00:16:33,030
Get him here.

303
00:16:34,730 --> 00:16:36,390
What do you want with Li Cheng?

304
00:16:37,550 --> 00:16:38,810
I'm turning myself in.

305
00:16:46,780 --> 00:16:47,510
Captain Fan.

306
00:16:52,910 --> 00:16:53,520
Wait.

307
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:57,140
The patient just woke up. He needs rest.

308
00:16:59,650 --> 00:17:01,120
Too many people.

309
00:17:01,630 --> 00:17:02,960
I can't breathe.

310
00:17:03,400 --> 00:17:05,290
Just leave Li Cheng here alone.

311
00:17:36,890 --> 00:17:37,720
Speak.

312
00:17:38,300 --> 00:17:39,560
What do you want to say?

313
00:17:40,960 --> 00:17:43,090
Visiting a dying patient

314
00:17:43,800 --> 00:17:46,210
without even bringing flowers or fruit?

315
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:47,980
You just came empty-handed?

316
00:17:48,810 --> 00:17:50,330
You want to turn yourself in.

317
00:17:50,330 --> 00:17:51,590
For which crime?

318
00:17:55,450 --> 00:17:56,270
Du Juan.

319
00:17:56,800 --> 00:17:57,910
I killed her.

320
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:01,370
With whom?

321
00:18:02,070 --> 00:18:04,500
Hu Xiaofei and Xin Xiaoliang.

322
00:18:05,790 --> 00:18:06,960
Xin Xiaoliang?

323
00:18:10,380 --> 00:18:11,520
W-What about her?

324
00:18:19,850 --> 00:18:21,180
Are you surprised?

325
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:24,140
After all these years,

326
00:18:24,310 --> 00:18:26,770
you haven't found a single clue.

327
00:18:27,420 --> 00:18:29,810
Do you still think she died innocent?

328
00:18:31,830 --> 00:18:32,960
How did you kill her?

329
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:37,000
On the night of April 17, 2004,

330
00:18:37,420 --> 00:18:40,030
we broke into Du Juan's dorm
and tied her up.

331
00:18:41,590 --> 00:18:43,420
Originally, I just wanted to ask

332
00:18:43,420 --> 00:18:45,400
if she was the one
who instigated Fang Meng

333
00:18:45,400 --> 00:18:46,480
to hit my mom.

334
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:49,580
But this bitch

335
00:18:50,010 --> 00:18:51,660
denied it

336
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:53,280
and dared to curse my mom.

337
00:18:54,570 --> 00:18:56,440
Since she had a death wish,

338
00:18:57,030 --> 00:18:59,090
I had to send her on her way.

339
00:19:01,250 --> 00:19:02,780
What did you use to kill her?

340
00:19:03,270 --> 00:19:05,930
Stabbed her to death
with a triangular scraper.

341
00:19:07,810 --> 00:19:08,870
Where did it come from?

342
00:19:08,870 --> 00:19:10,110
Xiaofei brought it.

343
00:19:11,290 --> 00:19:12,700
Xiaofei had committed crimes
with Song Laifu

344
00:19:12,700 --> 00:19:14,690
and Zhang Chengguo.

345
00:19:14,830 --> 00:19:16,370
He knew their methods.

346
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:18,360
Who stabbed her?

347
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:19,550
Does it matter?

348
00:19:20,380 --> 00:19:21,200
Who?

349
00:19:24,420 --> 00:19:26,480
The three of us each stabbed her once.

350
00:19:26,740 --> 00:19:27,750
A blood pact.

351
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:32,220
This is the first stab.

352
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:34,500
Two more to go.

353
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:36,880
You guys do it.

354
00:19:41,160 --> 00:19:41,980
Your turn.

355
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:53,680
Did you want to kill her

356
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:55,080
from the very beginning?

357
00:19:58,140 --> 00:20:00,220
I just wanted the truth.

358
00:20:00,980 --> 00:20:02,830
She didn't know what was good for her,

359
00:20:02,830 --> 00:20:04,160
so I made my move.

360
00:20:04,250 --> 00:20:05,090
If you really are

361
00:20:05,090 --> 00:20:07,300
one of the true culprits of the 3/12 Case,

362
00:20:07,300 --> 00:20:09,100
tell us something we don't know.

363
00:20:10,700 --> 00:20:12,640
We killed Du Juan by imitating

364
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:14,000
Song Laifu

365
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:16,130
and Zhang Chengguo's modus operandi,

366
00:20:16,270 --> 00:20:17,810
wanting to frame them.

367
00:20:18,590 --> 00:20:21,120
Later, I was worried
things would be exposed,

368
00:20:21,510 --> 00:20:23,240
so I finally made up my mind

369
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:25,110
to get rid of Song Laifu.

370
00:20:25,770 --> 00:20:27,770
Unfortunately, I was a step too late

371
00:20:28,140 --> 00:20:29,470
and got Xiaofei killed.

372
00:20:31,850 --> 00:20:34,460
It took some effort
when I killed Song Laifu.

373
00:20:35,410 --> 00:20:37,850
I originally wanted to frame Xin Jiran,

374
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:40,140
but unfortunately, I failed.

375
00:20:40,270 --> 00:20:41,440
You just said

376
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:42,740
that you and Xin Xiaoliang

377
00:20:42,740 --> 00:20:45,220
had a relationship
in which you could kill together.

378
00:20:45,220 --> 00:20:46,960
Then why did you frame

379
00:20:46,960 --> 00:20:49,160
Xin Xiaoliang's father for the murder,

380
00:20:49,310 --> 00:20:51,370
who was also a former police officer?

381
00:20:53,770 --> 00:20:55,180
As a father,

382
00:20:55,420 --> 00:20:57,280
he caused the death of his own son,

383
00:20:57,810 --> 00:20:59,740
my good brother Xin Xiaoliang.

384
00:21:00,220 --> 00:21:01,790
As a police officer,

385
00:21:02,110 --> 00:21:05,570
he knew my mom's death was suspicious
but didn't investigate.

386
00:21:05,620 --> 00:21:07,810
Do you think he deserves to be a father

387
00:21:07,940 --> 00:21:09,500
or a police officer?

388
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:12,140
Is killing

389
00:21:12,240 --> 00:21:14,270
the only way out for you?

390
00:21:22,990 --> 00:21:32,210
[Ping'an City Cultural Activity Center,
Ping'an Province]

391
00:22:03,910 --> 00:22:04,890
Go on.

392
00:22:05,320 --> 00:22:06,160
What else?

393
00:22:08,410 --> 00:22:10,820
Someone took Song Laifu's identity.

394
00:22:10,950 --> 00:22:13,140
You already know that, right?

395
00:22:14,030 --> 00:22:15,880
His real name is Guo Sanjun.

396
00:22:16,590 --> 00:22:17,960
That's not enough.

397
00:22:18,140 --> 00:22:19,780
I need direct evidence.

398
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:23,180
There's an encrypted hard drive

399
00:22:23,180 --> 00:22:25,040
in the drawer at my internet cafe.

400
00:22:25,270 --> 00:22:27,490
It has what you want.

401
00:22:27,790 --> 00:22:28,790
A hard drive?

402
00:22:30,410 --> 00:22:31,610
What's the password?

403
00:22:35,330 --> 00:22:37,700
If you can't even guess that,

404
00:22:38,030 --> 00:22:40,790
I'll be very disappointed, Officer Li.

405
00:22:42,880 --> 00:22:44,880
Why turn yourself in all of a sudden?

406
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:51,240
As a friend,

407
00:22:51,640 --> 00:22:53,440
I'm giving your career a boost.

408
00:22:54,570 --> 00:22:56,740
And I hope that when I go to hell,

409
00:22:57,180 --> 00:23:00,880
the King of Hell will give me some credit

410
00:23:01,130 --> 00:23:02,810
for confessing.

411
00:23:07,460 --> 00:23:08,680
We all agree that

412
00:23:08,740 --> 00:23:10,850
Han Pinmu forged the group photo

413
00:23:10,850 --> 00:23:11,810
to protect the third person

414
00:23:11,810 --> 00:23:13,660
who hasn't been exposed.

415
00:23:13,660 --> 00:23:15,790
But Xin Xiaoliang has long been dead.

416
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:17,330
Who is he putting on this show for

417
00:23:17,330 --> 00:23:18,940
with all this effort?

418
00:23:20,200 --> 00:23:20,960
Li Cheng.

419
00:23:23,090 --> 00:23:23,810
Li Cheng!

420
00:23:25,270 --> 00:23:26,050
Captain Fan.

421
00:23:26,090 --> 00:23:27,330
How's it going with the password?

422
00:23:27,330 --> 00:23:29,110
The cybersecurity colleagues
are working on it.

423
00:23:29,110 --> 00:23:30,000
But they said

424
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:31,920
cracking a hard drive
with such strong encryption

425
00:23:31,920 --> 00:23:33,790
would take at least a few days.

426
00:23:33,830 --> 00:23:36,360
None of the passwords
I could think of worked.

427
00:23:37,310 --> 00:23:38,400
Repeat

428
00:23:38,750 --> 00:23:39,850
what he said

429
00:23:39,850 --> 00:23:40,910
about Chen Chunli.

430
00:23:42,140 --> 00:23:43,220
He said Chen Chunli

431
00:23:43,220 --> 00:23:44,720
somehow found out that

432
00:23:44,720 --> 00:23:46,050
the police suspected Han Pinmu

433
00:23:46,050 --> 00:23:47,590
was the suspect in the 3/12 Case.

434
00:23:47,590 --> 00:23:49,720
So Chen Chunli went to him for revenge.

435
00:23:49,720 --> 00:23:50,980
But Han Pinmu told her

436
00:23:50,980 --> 00:23:52,160
he only killed Du Juan

437
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:53,550
and wasn't involved in her case.

438
00:23:53,550 --> 00:23:54,680
Chen Chunli didn't believe him

439
00:23:54,680 --> 00:23:56,090
and hit him with something.

440
00:23:56,090 --> 00:23:57,090
Not long after she hit him,

441
00:23:57,090 --> 00:23:58,750
Xin Jiran knocked on the door.

442
00:23:58,830 --> 00:24:00,700
She recognized Xin Jiran's voice

443
00:24:00,740 --> 00:24:02,490
and jumped out the window,

444
00:24:02,520 --> 00:24:04,720
afraid of being charged
by the police with assault.

445
00:24:04,720 --> 00:24:06,010
If so,

446
00:24:06,030 --> 00:24:08,570
why did he need to clean up the scene?

447
00:24:08,680 --> 00:24:10,970
His surrender seems reasonable,

448
00:24:11,050 --> 00:24:13,580
but it's actually full of
suspicious points.

449
00:24:16,980 --> 00:24:19,090
You guys are the ones saying everything.

450
00:24:19,090 --> 00:24:20,380
You said it yourselves

451
00:24:20,380 --> 00:24:21,240
that this guy was suspicious,

452
00:24:21,240 --> 00:24:22,820
tracking and tailing.

453
00:24:22,880 --> 00:24:23,980
Now that he's surrendered,

454
00:24:23,980 --> 00:24:25,310
you're hesitating

455
00:24:25,310 --> 00:24:26,810
and acting all coy.

456
00:24:26,810 --> 00:24:28,050
How long has it been?

457
00:24:28,350 --> 00:24:30,440
You have to give me a result,
so I can report back.

458
00:24:30,440 --> 00:24:31,850
What's the rush?

459
00:24:31,850 --> 00:24:33,180
We've waited for 8 years.

460
00:24:33,180 --> 00:24:34,660
A little longer won't hurt.

461
00:24:34,660 --> 00:24:35,250
Right,

462
00:24:35,250 --> 00:24:36,930
what about Guo Sanjun?

463
00:24:37,610 --> 00:24:39,010
Still no news from Hu Sen.

464
00:24:39,380 --> 00:24:40,460
If it's true,

465
00:24:40,460 --> 00:24:43,520
he's deeply involved
with the suspect in the 3/12 Case.

466
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:45,070
Xu Ling,

467
00:24:45,240 --> 00:24:46,720
make a call and ask. Be quick.

468
00:24:46,720 --> 00:24:47,350
Okay.

469
00:24:49,110 --> 00:24:50,920
Chen Chunli is still tight-lipped?

470
00:24:50,920 --> 00:24:51,770
Yeah,

471
00:24:52,030 --> 00:24:53,290
she's as hard as nails.

472
00:24:55,680 --> 00:24:57,570
Then interrogate her again
based on the clues

473
00:24:57,570 --> 00:24:58,530
provided by Han Pinmu.

474
00:24:58,530 --> 00:24:59,530
Pry her mouth open

475
00:24:59,550 --> 00:25:00,450
no matter what.

476
00:25:28,680 --> 00:25:29,550
Don't move.

477
00:25:29,660 --> 00:25:31,440
If you don't put medicine on this ankle,

478
00:25:31,440 --> 00:25:32,840
you won't be able to walk.

479
00:25:38,310 --> 00:25:39,710
I noticed you were limping

480
00:25:39,710 --> 00:25:41,630
as soon as you walked in.

481
00:25:42,660 --> 00:25:44,060
You can't hold on anymore

482
00:25:44,250 --> 00:25:46,110
after sitting for so long, right?

483
00:25:48,220 --> 00:25:50,590
You've been through a lot,

484
00:25:50,610 --> 00:25:53,400
yet you climbed walls and jumped
off buildings like a youngster.

485
00:25:53,400 --> 00:25:54,840
At your age,

486
00:25:54,870 --> 00:25:56,470
your bones can't take a fall.

487
00:25:57,380 --> 00:25:58,910
Han Pinmu has surrendered.

488
00:26:06,320 --> 00:26:07,190
Look familiar?

489
00:26:10,830 --> 00:26:11,660
I've seen it.

490
00:26:14,220 --> 00:26:15,110
Eight years ago,

491
00:26:15,110 --> 00:26:17,310
this photo was posted all over the city.

492
00:26:17,330 --> 00:26:19,480
You were offering a reward for this man.

493
00:26:19,480 --> 00:26:21,060
You have a good memory

494
00:26:21,220 --> 00:26:22,900
and strong nerves.

495
00:26:26,240 --> 00:26:28,370
What does this have to do with Han Pinmu

496
00:26:28,540 --> 00:26:30,050
turning himself in?

497
00:26:32,340 --> 00:26:34,160
The man in the photo is him?

498
00:26:44,990 --> 00:26:47,750
What do you think he confessed to?

499
00:26:47,780 --> 00:26:49,230
What else could it be?

500
00:26:49,500 --> 00:26:50,920
He's a murderer

501
00:26:50,940 --> 00:26:52,520
and a rapist.

502
00:26:52,550 --> 00:26:55,010
You should have arrested
him a long time ago.

503
00:26:55,030 --> 00:26:56,550
So you admit

504
00:26:56,570 --> 00:26:58,050
that you attacked him

505
00:26:58,080 --> 00:27:00,050
because you suspected

506
00:27:00,070 --> 00:27:02,070
he was the one who hurt you back then?

507
00:27:07,850 --> 00:27:09,850
I admit I hit Han Pinmu.

508
00:27:09,850 --> 00:27:10,850
With what?

509
00:27:10,850 --> 00:27:14,450
The bronze antelope ornament on his table.

510
00:27:17,220 --> 00:27:18,790
He's a grown man.

511
00:27:18,790 --> 00:27:20,160
He just stood there and let you hit him?

512
00:27:20,160 --> 00:27:21,360
He didn't fight back?

513
00:27:21,420 --> 00:27:23,350
He seemed very sick,

514
00:27:24,070 --> 00:27:25,520
coughing non-stop.

515
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:28,380
So he wasn't even as strong as me.

516
00:27:30,710 --> 00:27:33,280
Then why did you escape
through the window?

517
00:27:34,090 --> 00:27:35,500
After I hit him,

518
00:27:36,500 --> 00:27:38,680
his head kept bleeding,

519
00:27:39,010 --> 00:27:40,270
which terrified me.

520
00:27:42,000 --> 00:27:43,270
Then I heard someone banging on the door.

521
00:27:43,270 --> 00:27:43,880
Judging by the voice,

522
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:45,350
it should be Xin Jiran.

523
00:27:45,350 --> 00:27:46,350
Han Pinmu!

524
00:27:46,640 --> 00:27:47,440
Open the door!

525
00:27:48,270 --> 00:27:49,370
Han Pinmu!

526
00:27:50,610 --> 00:27:53,090
I know his relationship with the police.

527
00:27:54,090 --> 00:27:54,830
If he saw

528
00:27:54,830 --> 00:27:56,800
I beat someone up like that,

529
00:27:57,110 --> 00:27:58,790
he would definitely arrest me.

530
00:27:58,790 --> 00:28:01,400
So I pushed Han Pinmu away

531
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:02,880
and jumped out

532
00:28:02,880 --> 00:28:05,750
the window

533
00:28:05,750 --> 00:28:07,520
in his bedroom's bathroom.

534
00:28:10,110 --> 00:28:12,030
What did Han Pinmu say

535
00:28:12,160 --> 00:28:13,250
when you confronted him?

536
00:28:13,250 --> 00:28:14,610
What else could he say?

537
00:28:16,070 --> 00:28:17,270
Just making excuses.

538
00:28:17,580 --> 00:28:19,030
People like him

539
00:28:20,460 --> 00:28:22,200
are full of lies.

540
00:28:22,230 --> 00:28:23,810
Back then, you clearly identified

541
00:28:23,810 --> 00:28:25,510
the 3 people who hurt you

542
00:28:25,540 --> 00:28:26,720
as 2 middle-aged men

543
00:28:26,740 --> 00:28:27,800
and one young man.

544
00:28:28,270 --> 00:28:30,140
Han Pinmu and Bi Dehua
are about the same age.

545
00:28:30,140 --> 00:28:32,250
They are obviously not middle-aged.

546
00:28:32,270 --> 00:28:34,880
So why did you think it was him?

547
00:28:35,250 --> 00:28:36,590
I've said it many times.

548
00:28:36,590 --> 00:28:37,740
It was too dark then,

549
00:28:37,740 --> 00:28:39,700
and the scene was very chaotic.

550
00:28:39,700 --> 00:28:40,880
I might have just identified
the wrong person.

551
00:28:40,880 --> 00:28:43,070
Or I just saw it wrong, right?

552
00:28:47,120 --> 00:28:49,050
You can't expect someone

553
00:28:49,170 --> 00:28:50,870
who almost died

554
00:28:51,380 --> 00:28:53,110
to clearly remember

555
00:28:53,130 --> 00:28:55,460
every detail of the crime scene.

556
00:28:58,200 --> 00:29:00,090
With your logic and reflexes,

557
00:29:00,110 --> 00:29:02,770
being a cleaner is a waste of your talent.

558
00:29:06,560 --> 00:29:08,690
I admit I hit Han Pinmu.

559
00:29:09,960 --> 00:29:11,310
I'll accept

560
00:29:12,400 --> 00:29:14,260
whatever sentence or punishment

561
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:16,090
you give me.

562
00:29:22,320 --> 00:29:23,400
You can go.

563
00:29:23,430 --> 00:29:26,430
Han Pinmu said
he wouldn't press charges against you.

564
00:29:59,900 --> 00:30:00,920
Chen Chunli.

565
00:30:02,420 --> 00:30:03,460
Do you hate him?

566
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:05,810
Yes.

567
00:30:07,880 --> 00:30:09,200
