571
00:30:25,530 --> 00:30:27,470
He ruined my entire family too.

572
00:30:30,180 --> 00:30:31,350
He deserves to die.

573
00:30:32,510 --> 00:30:34,600
Even if he dies 100 times,

574
00:30:37,090 --> 00:30:39,000
