gave her confidence.

582
00:31:02,060 --> 00:31:03,540
The two of them cooperated

583
00:31:03,570 --> 00:31:04,870
and put on a show.

584
00:31:09,220 --> 00:31:10,530
At least, it proves

585
00:31:10,590 --> 00:31:13,380
Xin had nothing to do
with Han Pinmu's injury.

